<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady/off $0.25 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly steady to $0.25 lower than Friday's close. Top $56.50 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     56.25-56.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     56.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     54.00-55.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     51.00-53.50</p>
<p>Sows:   300-450 lbs 1.00 lower; 450-500 lbs steady; 500-700 lbs</p>
<p>0.50 to  1.50 higher. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs	45.50</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	46.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	47.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	48.00</p>
</text>
